    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Form lead → CRM, AI rating, Klaviyo segment\n\n### How it works\n1. A website form sends the lead to the **webhook**; the fields are parsed.\n2. Instantly: the lead is logged to **Sheets**, created in **Zoho CRM** and announced in **Telegram**.\n3. **AI rates the lead** hot / warm / cold. An invalid answer falls back to warm.\n4. The lead is added to the matching **Klaviyo list** for nurturing.\n5. The rating is written back to the lead in Zoho.\n\n### Setup\n- Connect Zoho CRM, Google Sheets, Telegram, OpenAI and a Klaviyo API key (header auth).\n- Set the three Klaviyo list IDs in **Klaviyo list: hot / warm / cold**.\n- Set your Telegram chat ID and sheet ID.\n- Map your form labels in **Parse form fields**.\n\n[Prompt not published in this showcase.]",
        "height": 756,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "b4ab77d6-4b71-49bc-a075-2cd7591305cc",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1122,
        -234
      ]
    }
